{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_9_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_9","textTraditional":"一、九年，春，天王使南季來聘。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_9_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_9","textTraditional":"二、三月癸酉，大雨震電。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_9_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_9","textTraditional":"何以書？記異也。何異爾？不時也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_9_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_9","textTraditional":"三、庚辰，大雨雪。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_9_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_9","textTraditional":"何以書？記異也。何異爾？俶甚也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_9_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_9","textTraditional":"四、俠卒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_9_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_9","textTraditional":"俠者何？吾大夫之未命者也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_9_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_9","textTraditional":"五、夏，城郎。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_9_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_9","textTraditional":"六、秋，七月。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_9_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_9","textTraditional":"七、冬，公會齊侯于邴。","sentenceOrder":10}],"overrides":{}}